{"3551170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flat Mars", "steam_appid": 3551170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4822850], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demented deity has taken up residency on Mars. Spacetime is warping and Mars has turned both flat and round. Your mission is to harvest its divine organs. But be prepared, a god has many minions. Fight through millions of mutant demons to claim the relics of the god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looping Mars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/44dcb5ae0aaa58ab99e02e8b83bad774.poster.avif?t=1783338874\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/44dcb5ae0aaa58ab99e02e8b83bad774.webm?t=1783338874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/44dcb5ae0aaa58ab99e02e8b83bad774.mp4?t=1783338874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a looping Mars and find its secrets and challenges. Complete them and be rewarded with powerful relics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hordes of Demons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/9cab0feba1cc41e70534017c1f618c06.poster.avif?t=1783338874\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/9cab0feba1cc41e70534017c1f618c06.webm?t=1783338874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/9cab0feba1cc41e70534017c1f618c06.mp4?t=1783338874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enormous swarms of demonic mutants while never slowing down. Jetpack above them, ski around them or soar through the sky to avoid their rage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Total Destruction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/962de1b081ce519640a48d2c2aa57398.poster.avif?t=1783338874\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/962de1b081ce519640a48d2c2aa57398.webm?t=1783338874\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/962de1b081ce519640a48d2c2aa57398.mp4?t=1783338874\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tear through the terrain with an arsenal of futuristic weapons. Burn through rock and flesh with screeching beam weapons. Fire mountain-rising grenades or enormous nukes that obliterate everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A demented deity has taken up residency on Mars. Spacetime is warping and Mars has turned both flat and round. Your mission is to harvest its divine organs. But be prepared, a god has many minions. Fight through millions of mutant demons to claim the relics of the god.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Looping Mars</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/44dcb5ae0aaa58ab99e02e8b83bad774.poster.avif?t=1783338874\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551170/extras/44dcb5ae0aaa58ab99e02e8b83bad774.webm?t=1783338874\" type=\"vid